WEBVTT

01:37.487 --> 01:38.487
<b>In my original plan,</b>

01:38.607 --> 01:41.737
<b>I would have feasted
on your powers by now.</b>

01:42.067 --> 01:44.487
<b>Well... What a shame.</b>

01:44.867 --> 01:47.497
<b>Had I done so, however...</b>

01:49.287 --> 01:52.497
<b>I suppose I wouldn't have
had this final opportunity to chit-chat.</b>

01:53.667 --> 01:54.747
<b>Rago.</b>

01:55.247 --> 01:58.457
<b>Do you have any recollection of
your first few moments?</b>

01:58.757 --> 02:01.627
<b>Huh? Who the hell remembers
what it was like when they were born?</b>

02:02.137 --> 02:04.257
<b>You happen to be speaking to one...</b>

02:05.097 --> 02:08.057
<b>I remember everything
vividly, exactly...</b>

02:08.927 --> 02:11.597
<b>I had just acquired
this physical form when,</b>

02:11.977 --> 02:13.557
<b>against the inky blackness
of the night,</b>

02:13.607 --> 02:16.267
<b>I gazed upon a lonely,
but radiant full moon.</b>

02:16.897 --> 02:19.527
<b>Parents and children are
not part of our existence.</b>

02:20.197 --> 02:23.157
<b>The winds carry passion, hatred,
the stuff of daydreams...</b>

02:23.357 --> 02:25.867
<b>Those products of life drift
and mingle, and then,</b>

02:25.947 --> 02:27.617
<b>suddenly,
they manifest and materialize.</b>

02:28.117 --> 02:31.037
<b>That is how we, mononoke,
come into being.</b>

02:32.327 --> 02:34.037
<b>We are strangers in a strange land,</b>

02:34.127 --> 02:36.247
<b>beings without a home or family.</b>

02:36.917 --> 02:40.547
<b>We are aberrations, freaks of nature.</b>

02:47.137 --> 02:50.057
<b>What a fine jewel of a woman
we have here!</b>

02:50.137 --> 02:51.887
<b>Please, I beg of you...</b>

02:52.437 --> 02:53.807
<b>Have mercy on my soul.</b>

02:54.147 --> 02:57.017
<b>N-Now, don't you fret, my beauty!</b>

02:57.147 --> 02:59.067
<b>Paradise awaits!</b>

03:03.107 --> 03:05.447
<b>Wh-Who goes there?!</b>

03:05.697 --> 03:08.077
<b><i>Mononoke... My kind.</i></b>

03:08.487 --> 03:10.077
<b>H-Help me!</b>

03:10.287 --> 03:11.497
<b><i>Humans...</i></b>

03:11.617 --> 03:12.827
<b><i>Such weaklings...</i></b>

03:14.037 --> 03:16.327
<b>A stranger you are!</b>

03:16.417 --> 03:19.377
<b>And into my domain you transgress!</b>

03:19.627 --> 03:22.337
<b>Now dieeeee!</b>

03:28.177 --> 03:30.097
<b><i>Hunger abated...</i></b>

03:30.177 --> 03:31.927
<b><i>Powers increased...</i></b>

03:32.057 --> 03:34.517
<b><i>But the flesh tastes spoilt.</i></b>

03:34.637 --> 03:35.687
<b>Uh-um...</b>

03:37.357 --> 03:41.107
<b>Forgive my ignorance,
for I know not your godly face!</b>

03:41.567 --> 03:43.777
<b>I owe you my life!</b>

03:44.237 --> 03:46.857
<b>With humility, I praise thee!</b>

03:47.277 --> 03:50.617
<b><i>So mankind sees mononoke as the divine.</i></b>

03:51.117 --> 03:55.117
<b>May I be honored to hear thy name?</b>

03:55.667 --> 03:57.247
<b>You may call me...</b>

03:58.247 --> 04:01.337
<b><i>As if nature herself</i>
<i>wrote it into law...</i></b>

04:01.417 --> 04:04.377
<b><i>I became god of the village.</i></b>

04:05.087 --> 04:09.047
<b>Lord Amagi, you graciousness
has brought peace to this village!</b>

04:09.347 --> 04:13.137
<b>Please accept
our humble offering of thanks!</b>

04:13.557 --> 04:14.637
<b>Hmm.</b>

04:14.767 --> 04:16.387
<b><i>I learned later...</i></b>

04:17.017 --> 04:20.897
<b><i>The mononoke I had slain</i>
<i>was once the villagers' deity...</i></b>

04:21.317 --> 04:24.647
<b><i>The ogre was a heinous presence</i>
<i>that darkened their lives.</i></b>

04:25.277 --> 04:27.237
<b><i>His tyranny had traumatized their souls.</i></b>

04:27.357 --> 04:30.237
<b><i>Fear tinged their awe</i>
<i>and venerance of me.</i></b>

04:30.407 --> 04:31.947
<b><i>They erected a shrine in my honor</i></b>

04:31.987 --> 04:34.657
<b><i>and made regular offerings</i>
<i>of rice and sake.</i></b>

04:35.247 --> 04:40.667
<b><i>In return, I kept countless threats</i>
<i>to the village at bay.</i></b>

04:41.247 --> 04:44.667
<b><i>Bandits, rogue samurai, thieves...</i></b>

04:44.757 --> 04:46.547
<b><i>And of course, mononoke.</i></b>

04:48.007 --> 04:50.047
<b><i>I battled, I killed.</i></b>

04:50.177 --> 04:51.427
<b><i>I was worshipped...</i></b>

04:51.507 --> 04:54.387
<b><i>My position was ironclad. </i></b>

04:55.017 --> 04:58.017
<b><i>I had become the almighty.</i></b>

04:58.437 --> 05:02.437
<b><i>Their devotion in turn</i>
<i>molded my psyche.</i></b>

05:05.027 --> 05:06.317
<b>If I may so inquire...</b>

05:06.607 --> 05:08.277
<b>Lord Amagi...</b>

05:08.567 --> 05:11.117
<b>Do you ever desire
nourishment of the human kind?</b>

05:11.277 --> 05:12.447
<b>Human you say?</b>

05:12.827 --> 05:16.947
<b>The deity to precede your grace had
a taste for maiden lasses...</b>

05:17.537 --> 05:19.667
<b>Forgive me,
I am ashamed of my insolence...</b>

05:20.117 --> 05:22.417
<b>I cannot hide my shameful
curiosity.</b>

05:24.377 --> 05:26.007
<b>It is true, to mononoke,
there is</b>

05:26.047 --> 05:28.297
<b>nothing more restorative
than the flesh of a human.</b>

05:28.927 --> 05:32.967
<b>Its fortifying and healing effects
are almost instant.</b>

05:34.257 --> 05:36.847
<b>My current tastes lead me
toward rice and sake</b>

05:36.887 --> 05:38.977
<b>and away from human sustenance.</b>

05:39.637 --> 05:41.767
<b>Unless the need arose...</b>

05:44.767 --> 05:48.487
<b>I do not anticipate a change of diet.</b>

05:50.697 --> 05:54.737
<b><i>That, at the time, was not pity,</i>
<i>but my true self.</i></b>

05:54.987 --> 05:57.577
<b><i>The id and ego of my being</i>
<i>were in flux.</i></b>

05:57.867 --> 06:01.997
<b><i>There was no black or white,</i>
<i>just the gray of change.</i></b>

06:02.537 --> 06:04.247
<b><i>But that evening...</i></b>

06:04.377 --> 06:05.747
<b>Oh... Lord Amagi!</b>

06:06.207 --> 06:08.797
<b><i>Neighboring territories had launched</i>
<i>an organized attack.</i></b>

06:09.257 --> 06:11.217
<b><i>It was my first taste</i>
<i>of the bitterness of defeat.</i></b>

06:11.257 --> 06:13.757
<b><i>It shattered my confidence...</i></b>

06:13.887 --> 06:15.757
<b><i>My universe was shaken.</i></b>

06:17.387 --> 06:19.517
<b>I forced the vanguard into retreat...</b>

06:19.847 --> 06:21.807
<b>But they remain largely unharmed.</b>

06:22.307 --> 06:26.267
<b>I suspect, come dawn,
they shall return.</b>

06:26.607 --> 06:28.647
<b>In this condition, even I...</b>

06:29.027 --> 06:30.527
<b>N-No!</b>

06:30.817 --> 06:33.817
<b>Venerable elder,
we must take up arms as well!</b>

06:33.987 --> 06:35.907
<b>We lack the proper training!</b>

06:35.947 --> 06:37.327
<b>We would only...</b>

06:37.407 --> 06:39.907
<b>If we can just band together!</b>

06:40.077 --> 06:42.417
<b>-<i>Everyone, united...</i>
-We can't give up!</b>

06:42.497 --> 06:44.917
<b>-<i>Banded together...</i>
-We must fight!</b>

06:47.877 --> 06:49.837
<b>Gather together!</b>

06:53.087 --> 06:54.797
<b>Now, Lord Amagi...</b>

06:55.507 --> 06:57.807
<b>To you, we offer this sacrifice.</b>

06:58.137 --> 07:01.307
<b>Eat, it will heal your wounds!</b>

07:01.767 --> 07:05.267
<b>-Be our savior once again!
-Please! Have mercy!</b>

07:05.307 --> 07:06.147
<b>Please!</b>

07:06.727 --> 07:08.857
<b>Lord Amagi... Lord Amagi...</b>

07:08.977 --> 07:11.067
<b>Lord Amagi... Lord Amagi...</b>

07:11.647 --> 07:13.067
<b>Lord Amagi...</b>

07:14.237 --> 07:16.067
<b>Lord Amagi... Lord Amagi...</b>

07:16.447 --> 07:17.407
<b>Lord Amagi...</b>

07:17.487 --> 07:19.037
<b>Lord Amagi...</b>

07:20.867 --> 07:24.077
<b>The elder had unerring judgment.</b>

07:24.667 --> 07:26.957
<b>A village teetering on extinction</b>

07:27.037 --> 07:29.837
<b>was saved by the sacrifice of one.</b>

07:30.837 --> 07:33.217
<b>They lived solely because in me,
in the powerful,</b>

07:33.257 --> 07:35.337
<b>they poured the entirety of their faith.</b>

07:36.427 --> 07:40.847
<b>Koga may call me a monster,
but he is mistaken.</b>

07:41.467 --> 07:43.937
<b>I am the true mononoke.</b>

07:45.227 --> 07:46.687
<b>From this day forward,</b>

07:46.727 --> 07:49.187
<b>mononoke shall no longer
remain a collective name.</b>

07:49.317 --> 07:52.357
<b>It shall be reserved
for the almighty Amagi alone!</b>

07:52.777 --> 07:54.947
<b>The one seated at the pinnacle,</b>

07:55.027 --> 07:57.867
<b>the one who guides
the unknowing to the just.</b>

07:58.657 --> 08:02.327
<b>That, and that alone,
is the true mononoke.</b>

08:04.827 --> 08:05.667
<b>This's Shiba.</b>

08:05.997 --> 08:08.127
<b>Get the medics ready immediately.</b>

08:08.707 --> 08:11.627
<b>So, can he
control Rago's power now?</b>

08:13.377 --> 08:14.967
<b>I think we expected too much...</b>

08:15.127 --> 08:17.297
<b>A few days to
master a mononoke's powers,</b>

08:17.337 --> 08:20.887
<b>let alone a human trying to
control the power of Rago...</b>

08:21.677 --> 08:24.807
<b>He might be able to wield
the power for thirty minutes,</b>

08:25.347 --> 08:28.647
<b>likely less than half that time
under the stress of real-world combat.</b>

08:29.107 --> 08:30.107
<b>In other words...</b>

08:30.187 --> 08:32.647
<b>...at best 'round ten minutes
is what I'm hearing.</b>

08:33.107 --> 08:36.857
<b>And if he tries to use
the power longer?</b>

08:37.067 --> 08:39.407
<b>He'll flip out, go berserk.</b>

08:39.817 --> 08:41.407
<b>Or he could stop being human.</b>

08:41.447 --> 08:44.697
<b>Alternatively his body could give out,
heart could stop.</b>

08:44.997 --> 08:47.867
<b>All possibilities put him
in extreme danger.</b>

08:49.247 --> 08:50.127
<b>Jiro!</b>

08:50.537 --> 08:54.167
<b>Ah, so big important Chief
finally decided to show up.</b>

08:54.457 --> 08:57.427
<b>I know I'm late, I'm sorry.</b>

08:58.007 --> 08:59.927
<b>Tell 'em yet, Ibuki?</b>

09:00.677 --> 09:01.547
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:01.797 --> 09:03.307
<b>All right.</b>

09:04.177 --> 09:05.807
<b>I'm sorry, Gramps.</b>

09:06.677 --> 09:08.637
<b>I sure fought like hell,</b>

09:08.687 --> 09:10.517
<b>but guess it wasn't enough.</b>

09:10.857 --> 09:11.767
<b>Jiro...</b>

09:12.397 --> 09:13.567
<b>But...</b>

09:14.357 --> 09:16.277
<b>I'm not sitting this one out.</b>

09:16.987 --> 09:18.067
<b>I'm gonna...</b>

09:18.197 --> 09:19.907
<b>I'm gonna save Rago!</b>

09:20.237 --> 09:22.327
<b>Then I'm gonna bash
that Amagi's face in!</b>

09:22.577 --> 09:23.737
<b>W-What...?</b>

09:23.777 --> 09:25.197
<b>I know!</b>

09:25.407 --> 09:27.827
<b>I'm still half a man yet, right?</b>

09:28.537 --> 09:29.747
<b>You know, before...</b>

09:29.787 --> 09:32.207
<b>I thought I could figure
this kinda stuff out on my own.</b>

09:32.787 --> 09:36.587
<b>But I think it finally
got through this thick skull.</b>

09:36.957 --> 09:41.587
<b>That I'm a snot-nosed kid
who knows he needs some help.</b>

09:42.597 --> 09:43.547
<b>So well...</b>

09:43.847 --> 09:45.217
<b>Whaddya say...</b>

09:46.677 --> 09:47.597
<b>Hate to ask, but...</b>

09:47.637 --> 09:49.347
<b>Will ya guys give me a hand?</b>

09:56.937 --> 09:57.777
<b>Yeah...</b>

09:57.817 --> 09:59.237
<b>You got it.</b>

10:01.317 --> 10:04.117
<b>Well, the forest awaits.</b>

10:04.777 --> 10:06.577
<b>It pains me to say goodbye,</b>

10:06.657 --> 10:09.867
<b>but the old pact to avoid crossing paths
whenever possible still stands.</b>

10:10.157 --> 10:11.707
<b>You guys shouldn't be apologizing.</b>

10:11.867 --> 10:13.877
<b>You've helped more than you know.</b>

10:14.537 --> 10:17.337
<b>Let's see how far that
"crazy" takes you.</b>

10:17.917 --> 10:19.627
<b>I've got high hopes, Jiro.</b>

10:19.917 --> 10:21.627
<b>Thanks.</b>

10:26.467 --> 10:27.887
<b>USAMI</b>

10:28.387 --> 10:29.227
<b><i>It's me.</i></b>

10:29.267 --> 10:31.097
<b>Chief! Oh, thank heavens it's you!</b>

10:31.347 --> 10:32.897
<b><i>Why, what's going on?</i></b>

10:33.187 --> 10:35.397
<b>Oh, for Pete's sake!</b>

10:35.437 --> 10:37.147
<b>Just hurry back as fast as you can!</b>

10:38.727 --> 10:40.147
<b>NOTICE
SERVICE SUSPENDED</b>

10:43.317 --> 10:44.657
<b>Stay vigilant!</b>

10:45.237 --> 10:46.487
<b>Director Kusumi...</b>

10:47.947 --> 10:51.657
<b>All roads in and out of the area
have been sealed.</b>

10:51.957 --> 10:52.827
<b>Well done.</b>

10:52.997 --> 10:54.917
<b>Make sure the right information gets out,</b>

10:54.957 --> 10:57.207
<b>and I want witnesses to
forget everything they've seen.</b>

10:57.457 --> 10:58.917
<b>Certainly. Right away, madame.</b>

11:00.127 --> 11:01.417
<b>Well, I'll be...</b>

11:01.837 --> 11:04.927
<b>They certainly aren't worried
'bout keeping a low profile.</b>

11:06.007 --> 11:09.637
<b>That takes balls setting up shop
right in front of HQ.</b>

11:11.557 --> 11:13.637
<b>Why would they choose here?</b>

11:14.057 --> 11:17.687
<b>They know we wouldn't be
able to miss 'em.</b>

11:18.317 --> 11:21.937
<b>Just makes it easier for them
to drag Jiro out.</b>

11:22.487 --> 11:24.277
<b>Sure is nice to be wanted!</b>

11:25.447 --> 11:27.947
<b>I was planning on busting
into their place anyway.</b>

11:28.157 --> 11:30.827
<b>'Sides, better out there than
in the middle of a bustlin' city.</b>

11:31.407 --> 11:33.247
<b>Found yourself some espionage gear, eh?</b>

11:33.537 --> 11:34.497
<b>You know it!</b>

11:34.827 --> 11:37.587
<b>Trusty ol' Tokieda got me
a new set right away.</b>

11:37.957 --> 11:39.547
<b>It's not some track suit.</b>

11:39.837 --> 11:42.377
<b>You have any idea
how much these things cost?</b>

11:42.757 --> 11:44.217
<b>So, they're kinda expensive?</b>

11:44.627 --> 11:46.717
<b>Let's see,
one like the suit you've got on...</b>

11:47.087 --> 11:50.347
<b>That's 'bout the cost of
your latest fighter jet.</b>

11:50.557 --> 11:51.597
<b>You're shitting me!</b>

11:51.967 --> 11:53.677
<b>So how much are we
talking about here?</b>

11:53.767 --> 11:56.977
<b>Think hard,
try using that imagination.</b>

11:58.267 --> 12:00.727
<b>Ten billion yen, at the very least.</b>

12:00.977 --> 12:02.027
<b>Reiji!</b>

12:02.317 --> 12:03.987
<b>Sorry to've kept everyone waiting.</b>

12:04.147 --> 12:07.487
<b>Reiji Kirihara reporting back for duty.</b>

12:08.157 --> 12:09.657
<b>All healed up I see.</b>

12:10.027 --> 12:10.947
<b>Yes...</b>

12:11.617 --> 12:13.157
<b>The mind can do
amazing things when</b>

12:13.197 --> 12:14.787
<b>one has a beautiful face
to return to!</b>

12:14.907 --> 12:16.167
<b>Oh, is that so...</b>

12:16.327 --> 12:17.997
<b>Ten billion...</b>

12:18.707 --> 12:20.247
<b>What do you think you're doingggg?!</b>

12:20.667 --> 12:22.247
<b>You there, dirty human!</b>

12:22.547 --> 12:24.877
<b>Step away from my bride now!</b>

12:24.967 --> 12:26.257
<b>Oh, give it a break!</b>

12:26.677 --> 12:27.967
<b>What is that?</b>

12:28.257 --> 12:30.507
<b>We've been busy, all right.</b>

12:30.847 --> 12:32.597
<b>He's helping us out,</b>

12:32.637 --> 12:35.427
<b>keeping this area blocked off
and safe with his spectral barrier.</b>

12:36.017 --> 12:39.727
<b>I get the sense he's not helping
out of the goodness of his heart.</b>

12:40.357 --> 12:44.397
<b>Well, on a different note,
the team's back together!</b>

12:44.897 --> 12:47.397
<b>So, should we have a little party
to celebrate Reiji's recovery?</b>

12:47.857 --> 12:50.657
<b>I don't think now's
the greatest time for a party.</b>

12:51.157 --> 12:54.407
<b>When this is all over,
I'd really like that.</b>

12:54.827 --> 12:55.787
<b>Huh?</b>

12:56.117 --> 12:57.537
<b>Hey Jiro!</b>

12:57.827 --> 13:00.917
<b>We'd finally starting
behaving like a team and...</b>

13:01.087 --> 13:02.797
<b>Sorry. It's just...</b>

13:03.547 --> 13:06.257
<b>Those bug-looking things
are kinda freaking me out.</b>

13:06.797 --> 13:07.797
<b>W-What is that?!</b>

13:07.877 --> 13:09.797
<b>Hands on your guns!
It's time!</b>

13:10.847 --> 13:11.797
<b>On your knees!</b>

13:11.847 --> 13:13.057
<b>Get your hands up!</b>

13:14.467 --> 13:15.927
<b>Human scum.</b>

13:17.727 --> 13:19.437
<b>Oh!  You're...</b>

13:19.897 --> 13:20.767
<b>Koga!</b>

13:21.437 --> 13:23.937
<b>Jiro Azuma.</b>

13:29.857 --> 13:31.697
<b>Hey, I said freeze!
Stop!</b>

13:35.947 --> 13:37.957
<b>I don't know why you're here...</b>

13:38.407 --> 13:40.957
<b>But I don't have time
to entertain you.</b>

13:41.327 --> 13:43.707
<b>If you wanna spar,
come back another time.</b>

13:45.797 --> 13:49.047
<b><i>That's just the kinda guy he is.</i></b>

13:53.637 --> 13:54.967
<b>-Hey, jerkoff!
-Shuddup!</b>

13:55.967 --> 13:57.137
<b>We need to talk.</b>

13:57.307 --> 13:58.477
<b>C'mere, dipshit.</b>

14:01.227 --> 14:02.227
<b>Cannibalism.</b>

14:02.937 --> 14:05.357
<b>And to think Amagi was sitting on
so much power.</b>

14:05.817 --> 14:07.607
<b>The guy's pure evil.</b>

14:08.147 --> 14:12.357
<b>So, the only ones left are
Amagi and Rago, right?</b>

14:13.817 --> 14:15.157
<b>I'm talkin' to you!</b>

14:15.197 --> 14:16.487
<b>And get over here!</b>

14:16.787 --> 14:18.447
<b>What's with this freak?</b>

14:18.787 --> 14:20.577
<b>I get the sense he's telling the truth.</b>

14:21.117 --> 14:23.917
<b>Besides, he probably doesn't have
a clue what to do next either.</b>

14:24.247 --> 14:25.247
<b>In any case...</b>

14:25.627 --> 14:28.207
<b>We can assume they won't try
to ambush us elsewhere.</b>

14:28.547 --> 14:30.297
<b>I want to focus our personnel here.</b>

14:30.797 --> 14:31.717
<b>And throw in backup—</b>

14:31.757 --> 14:33.297
<b>Director Kusumi!
We've got trouble!</b>

14:33.967 --> 14:35.297
<b>Fire! Fire! Fire!</b>

14:39.217 --> 14:40.477
<b>Do you read me, Director!</b>

14:40.557 --> 14:42.937
<b>We've got a swarm
on the west side of the harbor...</b>

14:45.057 --> 14:46.977
<b>We're swatting some,
but they're just too many!</b>

14:47.397 --> 14:48.567
<b><i>We need help!</i></b>

14:48.857 --> 14:50.027
<b><i>Inui here from the east!</i></b>

14:50.277 --> 14:52.527
<b><i>We're trying,</i>
<i>but it's not looking good!</i></b>

14:52.857 --> 14:55.447
<b><i>These things keep</i>
<i>pouring in from the gate!</i></b>

14:56.827 --> 14:59.617
<b>One on one they're shit,
but in these numbers...</b>

15:00.077 --> 15:01.997
<b>Any longer, and soon,</b>

15:02.037 --> 15:04.627
<b>they'll get past us
and breach the barrier!</b>

15:05.497 --> 15:08.127
<b>They're hatching from
the left and the right!</b>

15:08.547 --> 15:11.127
<b>It won't be long before
they come this way.</b>

15:11.757 --> 15:12.627
<b>So, what now?</b>

15:12.967 --> 15:14.177
<b>Fight 'em off from here?</b>

15:14.467 --> 15:16.387
<b>Yes, <i>we</i> will.</b>

15:16.967 --> 15:19.517
<b>But the clock's ticking
on your power.</b>

15:20.097 --> 15:22.387
<b>We can't afford to have you
use it all up here.</b>

15:23.097 --> 15:24.897
<b>You've got to get in there
and find Amagi now.</b>

15:25.597 --> 15:26.897
<b>Ichika, Reiji...</b>

15:27.307 --> 15:30.397
<b>Make sure Jiro gets to
that gate in one piece.</b>

15:30.777 --> 15:32.277
<b>Whatever you say, but...</b>

15:32.487 --> 15:34.147
<b>How're we supposed to get out there?</b>

15:35.987 --> 15:38.447
<b>Well, looks like it's finally
my turn to have some fun.</b>

15:38.487 --> 15:39.327
<b>Ya ready?</b>

15:39.577 --> 15:41.577
<b>Um, should I be scared?</b>

15:41.947 --> 15:43.907
<b>Humph, who do you think I am?</b>

15:44.997 --> 15:46.917
<b>I'm an immortal with powers
far beyond any human.</b>

15:47.377 --> 15:48.667
<b>I'm a mononoke!</b>

15:49.837 --> 15:51.917
<b>Makin' two or three pathetic humans...</b>

15:52.627 --> 15:55.757
<b>...float through the air like some silly
little butterflies is a piece of cake!</b>

15:56.337 --> 15:57.677
<b>I-I'm floating!</b>

15:58.387 --> 16:00.637
<b>I'll make sure you guys
stay floating.</b>

16:01.177 --> 16:03.427
<b>You gotta decide where you go!</b>

16:04.017 --> 16:05.437
<b>All right, Jiro.</b>

16:05.937 --> 16:07.767
<b>You're our last shot.</b>

16:08.437 --> 16:10.397
<b>I need you to hit Amagi
with everything you got.</b>

16:10.567 --> 16:12.567
<b>Keep that power of yours
to yourself till the gate.</b>

16:12.607 --> 16:14.107
<b>Know and trust
they've got your back.</b>

16:14.567 --> 16:15.447
<b>Got it.</b>

16:15.817 --> 16:17.237
<b>Ichika, Reiji...</b>

16:17.317 --> 16:18.487
<b>Keep him safe.</b>

16:18.737 --> 16:19.697
<b>-Got it.
-Got it.</b>

16:20.237 --> 16:22.077
<b>Now, go get 'em!</b>

16:31.297 --> 16:32.207
<b>Shit! Shit!</b>

16:33.587 --> 16:34.417
<b>Blast it!</b>

16:38.547 --> 16:39.677
<b>Honestly...</b>

16:40.887 --> 16:43.967
<b>You boys needed this old retiree's help
more than I thought.</b>

16:44.347 --> 16:45.177
<b>Now go!</b>

16:45.227 --> 16:48.347
<b>Pull your finger out
and get back out there, kid!</b>

16:48.647 --> 16:50.227
<b>Y-Yes sir!</b>

16:52.857 --> 16:56.737
<b>You better not make this dinosaur
outlive his grandson, Jiro.</b>

17:06.657 --> 17:08.247
<b>Hey, what're you doing?</b>

17:08.577 --> 17:09.877
<b>No time for daydreaming!</b>

17:10.207 --> 17:12.537
<b>Keep your ass moving!</b>

17:13.997 --> 17:15.797
<b>You're such a pleasure to work wi—</b>

17:16.127 --> 17:17.087
<b>Hey! Watch out!</b>

17:17.167 --> 17:18.007
<b>Huh?</b>

17:22.547 --> 17:24.097
<b>You aren't hurt, are you, Ichika?</b>

17:24.517 --> 17:25.597
<b>Please be careful.</b>

17:26.057 --> 17:29.597
<b>I know our mission is to deliver
this baggage unharmed, but still...</b>

17:29.807 --> 17:31.477
<b>Hey, the baggage's got ears!</b>

17:31.687 --> 17:33.017
<b>Dammit...</b>

17:33.067 --> 17:35.477
<b>This keeping my hands
to myself thing really sucks!</b>

17:35.857 --> 17:37.277
<b>Seems like a good opportunity...</b>

17:37.317 --> 17:39.737
<b>To learn a little self-restraint,
if you ask me.</b>

17:40.157 --> 17:42.487
<b>We're almost there now.</b>

17:43.157 --> 17:45.657
<b>They just keep coming,
no matter how many we swat.</b>

17:46.037 --> 17:48.497
<b>Obviously trying to go
after 'em all will only hurt us.</b>

17:48.997 --> 17:51.537
<b>We'll lure as many as
we can away from you!</b>

17:52.127 --> 17:55.047
<b>You focus on getting to
that gate as fast as you can.</b>

17:55.547 --> 17:58.547
<b>We'll keep 'em busy higher up.</b>

17:59.047 --> 18:00.297
<b>Just don't get surrounded.</b>

18:00.587 --> 18:02.547
<b>Stay close to the water's surface
and lay low!</b>

18:03.467 --> 18:04.677
<b>Hey, watch out!</b>

18:09.557 --> 18:11.557
<b>You sure you're gonna be okay?!</b>

18:12.267 --> 18:13.307
<b>Naturally!</b>

18:14.307 --> 18:15.817
<b>Losing isn't an option!</b>

18:16.647 --> 18:19.187
<b><i>I haven't forgotten 'bout you, Mom!</i></b>

18:21.737 --> 18:24.487
<b><i>I've still got a score to settle!</i></b>

18:33.627 --> 18:34.627
<b>Ohh!</b>

18:35.207 --> 18:37.627
<b>Told ya, leave this to us!</b>

18:39.087 --> 18:41.127
<b>Don't slack off and
get yourself killed, alright?</b>

18:41.587 --> 18:43.797
<b>You gotta stop taking my lines, loser.</b>

18:44.547 --> 18:45.507
<b>Clock's ticking.</b>

18:45.927 --> 18:47.137
<b>Let's go!</b>

18:54.477 --> 18:56.397
<b>I'm gonna have to use
some of that power!</b>

19:02.947 --> 19:03.777
<b>Wha...?!</b>

19:03.987 --> 19:05.527
<b>K-Koga...?</b>

19:05.907 --> 19:07.027
<b>Why are...?</b>

19:07.237 --> 19:08.287
<b>Wait... what...?</b>

19:08.867 --> 19:09.907
<b>Hey, wait!</b>

19:13.247 --> 19:14.287
<b>You...</b>

19:45.197 --> 19:46.947
<b>So you've arrived
ostensibly injury free.</b>

19:47.237 --> 19:49.077
<b>Quite competent indeed.</b>

19:49.657 --> 19:52.327
<b>I've been waiting for you, Jiro Azuma.</b>

19:52.697 --> 19:53.957
<b>Jiro...</b>

19:54.157 --> 19:55.457
<b>Hey, Rago!</b>

19:55.577 --> 19:57.627
<b>You're lookin' all cozy in there!</b>

19:57.747 --> 19:58.917
<b>Yeah, it's a regular cat bed!</b>

19:58.997 --> 20:00.707
<b>Don't blow a gasket.</b>

20:00.917 --> 20:02.707
<b>I'll get you outta
there in no time.</b>

20:06.757 --> 20:07.967
<b>So, Amagi...</b>

20:08.097 --> 20:09.757
<b>Why devour your own allies?</b>

20:10.467 --> 20:11.967
<b>Such a foolish question.</b>

20:12.467 --> 20:15.597
<b>Do you fire a hundred petty bullets
or one devastating missile?</b>

20:15.977 --> 20:18.307
<b>Concentrating one's power
into a single weapon</b>

20:18.357 --> 20:19.477
<b>is so much more effective.</b>

20:20.567 --> 20:22.567
<b>So you really do hate humans,
don't you?</b>

20:22.817 --> 20:24.737
<b>I no longer harbor hatred.</b>

20:25.317 --> 20:27.737
<b>I simply refuse to suffer
the injustice...</b>

20:28.277 --> 20:30.617
<b>...of a world where the weak
rule over the powerful.</b>

20:30.697 --> 20:31.867
<b>That's bullshit.</b>

20:32.077 --> 20:33.367
<b>It is logical.</b>

20:37.787 --> 20:40.287
<b>How'd ya like my camo thingamajig?</b>

20:40.667 --> 20:41.587
<b>Well?</b>

20:41.747 --> 20:44.127
<b>Even this weak human's got
the juice...</b>

20:44.297 --> 20:46.797
<b>...to reposition that smug jaw of yours.</b>

20:48.587 --> 20:49.967
<b>Infantile.</b>

20:50.547 --> 20:54.347
<b>Relying on gadgets and baubles
like a true weakling.</b>

20:55.517 --> 20:57.477
<b>Utterly shameful.</b>

20:57.557 --> 20:59.267
<b>Wholly disgraceful.</b>

21:00.767 --> 21:02.727
<b>Your little sideshow disgusts me.</b>

21:03.067 --> 21:05.937
<b>The power I seek resides not
in wearable ornaments.</b>

21:07.237 --> 21:08.197
<b>Rago!</b>

21:08.447 --> 21:09.737
<b>I'm gonna dip into that power...</b>

21:09.867 --> 21:11.027
<b>But only a little!</b>

21:19.577 --> 21:24.337
<b>Oh... So you managed to learn
something in a few days' time.</b>

21:25.087 --> 21:27.507
<b>Find someone willing
to teach you a few tricks?</b>

21:27.837 --> 21:30.007
<b>Sorry, no time for small talk.</b>

21:30.087 --> 21:32.757
<b>Like you said, let's skip
to the main attraction!</b>

21:45.147 --> 21:47.737
<b>Ah, the rush of nostalgia.</b>

21:48.237 --> 21:50.487
<b>It's been centuries.</b>

21:50.907 --> 21:53.737
<b>To taste, to feel, that luxurious
power flow through these veins again.</b>

21:54.027 --> 21:55.487
<b>You've exceeded my expectations.</b>

21:55.577 --> 21:58.997
<b>No, you go beyond the imagination,
Jiro Azuma.</b>

21:59.367 --> 22:02.497
<b>It means slightly more work...</b>

22:03.167 --> 22:05.747
<b>But strangely,
I find it all quite pleasurable.</b>

22:06.797 --> 22:08.007
<b>All right.</b>

22:10.047 --> 22:13.257
<b>I shall battle you, body and soul.</b>
